      "entry_id": "d7aa7df9166dc576457ed6b735b980893f5330f70ce866b6474d2414763fb113",
      "line": 5008,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/escort-quest-start.lua",
      "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#[Pretend to help but when it is time you will use a Ziguranth technique to make the portal fizzle. @npcname@ will be sent to Zigur to be 'dealt with' properly.]#WHITE#\nLead on; I will protect you.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#[假装帮忙，现在是你使用伊格兰斯的能力破坏传送门的时候了。@npcname@ 将会被送到伊格接受他应有的“待遇”。]#WHITE#\n带路，我会保护你的。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "d7aa7df9166dc576457ed6b735b980893f5330f70ce866b6474d2414763fb113"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "4fc041de5e2378669171b26164b51f2ccd867e5a956fdc79ca59863fd2b3882a",
      "line": 5011,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/escort-quest-start.lua",
      "source": "Escort",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "护送",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "4fc041de5e2378669171b26164b51f2ccd867e5a956fdc79ca59863fd2b3882a"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "f37c12ab5844e13debf6cecd69fd8c618b7780ec23f902462f9b0020a12744b1",
      "line": 5012,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/escort-quest-start.lua",
      "source": "Go away; I do not help filthy arcane users!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "走开，我不会帮助肮脏的奥术魔法信徒！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "f37c12ab5844e13debf6cecd69fd8c618b7780ec23f902462f9b0020a12744b1"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "a2cbe5414a92a0c3c39eaefe8d553ae3d8f2a2d7fbc5f237c1cd98573113617c",
      "line": 5013,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/escort-quest-start.lua",
      "source": "Lead on; I will protect you.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "带路，我会保护你的。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "a2cbe5414a92a0c3c39eaefe8d553ae3d8f2a2d7fbc5f237c1cd98573113617c"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "9e0fad3d78680343b5fee5940a6fd1011c66959f4ed01d66bbab65db25973608",
      "line": 5014,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/escort-quest-start.lua",
      "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#[Pretend to help but when it is time you will use a technique to make the portal fizzle. @npcname@ will be sent to Zigur to be 'dealt with' properly.]#WHITE#\nLead on; I will protect you.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#[假装帮忙，但时机一到，你将使用技巧让传送门失效。@npcname@ 将被送到伊格，得到“妥善”处置。]#WHITE#\n带路，我会保护你。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "9e0fad3d78680343b5fee5940a6fd1011c66959f4ed01d66bbab65db25973608"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "1b39b42c4e3764b881240c02fefe1c24f7caec3558baba1d31882c1520dd59bd",
      "line": 5017,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/escort-quest-start.lua",
      "source": "Go away; I do not care for the weak.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "走开，我可没有义务帮助弱者。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "1b39b42c4e3764b881240c02fefe1c24f7caec3558baba1d31882c1520dd59bd"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "0d024a43b8f630428ce58cd9ece19b84c5b396ea535a5ac6beb0632b9adc7802",
      "line": 5022,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/escort-quest.lua",
      "source": "At the last moment you invoke the power of nature.  The portal fizzles and transports @npcname@ to Zigur.\nYou can feel Nature thanking you.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "最后你召唤了自然之力，传送门发出嘶嘶的响声，将 @npcname@ 传送到了伊格。\n你可以感觉到自然对你的感激。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "0d024a43b8f630428ce58cd9ece19b84c5b396ea535a5ac6beb0632b9adc7802"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "b21bd3fbea6fe58b22ed6545160f4482e27a96b18e73062a5cee1b7073da4c50",
      "line": 5025,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/escort-quest.lua",
      "source": "Thank you, my friend. I do not think I would have survived without you.\nPlease let me reward you:",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "谢谢你我的朋友，要是没有你我就死定了。\n请让我报答你吧：",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "b21bd3fbea6fe58b22ed6545160f4482e27a96b18e73062a5cee1b7073da4c50"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "2b204a0c329772a0efd9dddfdc87dcda858c773d2e4c6a6010a2f7df40f0ab83",
      "line": 5028,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/escort-quest.lua",
      "source": "There you go. Farewell!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "那就这样吧，再见！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "2b204a0c329772a0efd9dddfdc87dcda858c773d2e4c6a6010a2f7df40f0ab83"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "36413e2cbdc1b7689cd41465d3b60291f378ca2b3827f9725d541c350864d162",
      "line": 5029,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/escort-quest.lua",
      "source": "Thank you.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "谢谢。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "36413e2cbdc1b7689cd41465d3b60291f378ca2b3827f9725d541c350864d162"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "69f06b2473643303d342313315f7c3fe2ad66fe79df2dca151f36d22596d0c4b",
      "line": 5034,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/fallen-aeryn.lua",
      "source": "%s grabs her amulet and disappears in a whirl of arcane energies.",
      "source_tag": "logPlayer",
      "special": null,
      "target": "%s 抓住了她的项链在一股奥术漩涡中消失了。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "69f06b2473643303d342313315f7c3fe2ad66fe79df2dca151f36d22596d0c4b"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "fdc1f017d7343df2e05e73caece485c778b20c13a02c8912eea63ab6044620ad",
      "line": 5035,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/fallen-aeryn.lua",
      "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*She lies nearly dead at your feet*#WHITE#\nSo, now you will kill me and complete the cycle of destruction?",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*她倒在你的脚下，快要死了。*#WHITE#\n那么，现在你会杀死我，完成这个毁灭的循环？",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "fdc1f017d7343df2e05e73caece485c778b20c13a02c8912eea63ab6044620ad"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "3da4c8a8366594fe430580ee533d54a2eb8f53e3757ceb1179290c8d4d67085a",
      "line": 5038,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/fallen-aeryn.lua",
      "source": "What are you talking about? Why did you attack me?",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "你在说什么？你为什么要攻击我？",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "3da4c8a8366594fe430580ee533d54a2eb8f53e3757ceb1179290c8d4d67085a"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "2666bd583dedd604815dd2d657a6ef85b4d931e1aa3812df5456d96d7f45efff",
      "line": 5039,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/fallen-aeryn.lua",
      "source": "Speak and I might spare you. Why did you attack me?",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "说吧，也许我会饶恕你，你为什么要攻击我？",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "2666bd583dedd604815dd2d657a6ef85b4d931e1aa3812df5456d96d7f45efff"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "2264bef72d04f2bc430f7e230856b673e91d7cc03327fe252bb02d3b3c5249f4",
      "line": 5040,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/fallen-aeryn.lua",
      "source": "[kill her]",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "[杀了她]",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "2264bef72d04f2bc430f7e230856b673e91d7cc03327fe252bb02d3b3c5249f4"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "32ab771f41cb24395f3baa2e864c14880143999c1d1f3f662d0be9912f605ec1",
      "line": 5041,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/fallen-aeryn.lua",
      "source": "You.. you do not know?\nA few hours after you entered this place a raid of orcs fell upon us. They were not alone -- demons walked among them. We were overwhelmed! Utterly destroyed!\nMy land is no more! All because you could not stop them at the Charred Scar! You failed us! People died to protect you, and you failed!\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*She starts to weep...*#WHITE#",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "你……你不知道？\n你进入这个地方几个小时以后，兽人突袭了我们。他们不是单独来的——还有大量恶魔跟随着他们。我们寡不敌众！被彻底击败了！\n我的领地已经不复存在！全都是因为你，没能在灼烧之痕阻止他们！你辜负了我们！这么多人为你而死，而你却辜负了我们！\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*她开始哭泣……*#WHITE#",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "32ab771f41cb24395f3baa2e864c14880143999c1d1f3f662d0be9912f605ec1"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "3f1a8f65ae9b6ecc4526de5506d96493747c2c2faafc23c860de4a9791b1b561",
      "line": 5048,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/fallen-aeryn.lua",
      "source": "I know my mistakes and I intend to correct them. Please let me pass. I cannot save your people, but I can make their deaths mean something!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "我知道我所犯下的错误，我会设法弥补。请让我通过这里，我没办法拯救你的人民，但是我不会让他们白白牺牲！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "3f1a8f65ae9b6ecc4526de5506d96493747c2c2faafc23c860de4a9791b1b561"
    }
  ],
  "adjudicated_findings": []
}
